            },
            "description": {
              "value": "With a bit of hide, some antlers, and some cast-off fur, you can create a disguise that will fool even an experienced hunter.\n\nYou can Impersonate creatures with the animal, beast, or plant traits, so long as they are either the same size or one size larger than you and have a body shape that conforms at least vaguely to your own (in other words, a typical humanoid could Impersonate a bear or an arboreal, but not a horse, giant scorpion, or assassin vine). Impersonating a larger creature doesn't change your actual size."
